1. Copy data
2. Ensure nodif is there
3. Ensure WMH mask is there
4. Register FLAIR to nodif (T2_to_nodif)
5. Make NAWM mask in nodif space (NAWM)
6. FA/MD/RD/AD analysis (AD_WMH_NAWM.sh) and extract WMH vol (WMH_Vol)
7. Make spherical masks (ROI_Sphere_Script_1_4.sh)
8. Binarize spherical masks for WMH (Bin_ring.sh)
9. Generate rings for spherical masks for WMH (Ring_Mask.sh)
10. FA/MD/RD/AD analysis (AD_Sphere_Analysis.sh)
11. NODDI analysis (ISOVF_WMH_NAWM.sh)
12. NODDI spherical analysis (ICVF_Sphere_Analysis.sh)   
12. Binarize XTRACT ROIs and threshold them (Bin_XTRACT.sh)
13. Extract LM from ROIs (XTRACT.sh)
14. Create NAWM ROIs 
15. Extract deep vs peri WMH if desired (and then register and conduct the above analyses again for NAWM vs WMH but instead all WMH but deep vs peri)
16. Invert the dMRI2stdviat1 warp (INVWARP)
17. Apply inverted warp to get ROIs in dif space
18. Extract DTI metrics from ROIs
19. Extract NODDI metrics from ROIs
